      <h2>About Chayce Properties</h2>
      <p><strong style="font-weight:400">Short (about 50 words):</strong> Chayce Properties Ltd is a Northampton-based later-life moving and downsizing service. It helps older people and their families move home anywhere in the UK, with one dedicated coordinator managing sorting, packing, fully insured removals, estate agent and solicitor liaison, and settling in.</p>
      <p><strong style="font-weight:400">Long (about 100 words):</strong> Chayce Properties Ltd, founded in 2026 and based on Kingsthorpe Road in Northampton, is a later-life moving and downsizing service for older people and the families who support them. Instead of separate companies for sorting, packing, removals and settling in, every client works with one dedicated coordinator for the whole move, and every removal is fully insured. Packages start at &pound;995, and a one-hour Discovery Consultation costs &pound;150. Chayce Properties arranges moves across the whole UK, including Northamptonshire and the East Midlands, London and the South East, the Home Counties, the South West and the Cotswolds.</p>
